---

<Base
  title="Custom Home Builder in Oro Valley, AZ | Lathrem Homebuilders"
  description="Licensed custom home builder in Oro Valley, Arizona. Ground-up residences, remodels and outdoor living on Pusch Ridge and Rancho Vistoso lots. AZ ROC #324057, 5.0 across 19 reviews."
  canonical="/custom-home-builder-oro-valley.html"
  schema={schema}
>
  <!-- ================= PAGE HEAD ================= -->
  <section class="pagehead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Areas served</p>
      <h1 class="display h-xl">Custom home builder in Oro Valley</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="max-width:58ch;margin-top:26px">Ground-up homes, remodels and outdoor living built into the upper bajada below Pusch Ridge, on the rolling, boulder-strewn lots that define the north side of the valley.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= LOCAL CONTEXT ================= -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split split--top">
        <div class="rv">
          <Photo src="sg-living.jpg" alt="Living room with a stone chimney wall opening onto the desert" />
        </div>
        <div class="rv rv-d1">
          <p class="eyebrow">Building here</p>
          <h2 class="display h-md" style="margin-bottom:24px">A town that reviews the house before it reviews the plans.</h2>
          <p class="lede">Oro Valley runs its own building department, and it is a more involved process than most first-time builders expect. Between the Environmentally Sensitive Lands provisions, the outdoor lighting code and neighbourhood design review in the master-planned communities, the approvals on an Oro Valley lot shape the house as much as the floor plan does.</p>
          <p class="lede">We would rather have that conversation before you buy the lot than after. Setbacks off a wash, how much of the natural grade has to stay, where the driveway can physically land on a rolling site, what the lighting code does to your exterior scheme. These are answerable questions early, and expensive ones late.</p>
          <p class="lede">We have built on exactly this kind of ground: granite outcrops left where they were, the house set into the site rather than cut out of it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= WHAT IT TAKES ================= -->
  <section class="section section--warm">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid-head rv">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What an Oro Valley build asks for</p>
          <h2 class="display h-lg">Three things worth getting right.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="svc">
        <div class="svc__i rv">
          <div class="svc__n">01</div>
          <h3>Grade and boulders</h3>
          <p>The rolling ground below the Catalinas is generous with views and unforgiving with foundations. Working with the existing grade, rather than flattening it, is what keeps the finished house sitting naturally on its lot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc__i rv rv-d1">
          <div class="svc__n">02</div>
          <h3>Design review</h3>
          <p>Rancho Vistoso, Stone Canyon and the other master-planned communities each run their own architectural review alongside the Town's. Submitting to both without the schedule slipping takes knowing what each one actually wants to see.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc__i rv rv-d2">
          <div class="svc__n">03</div>
          <h3>Dark-sky lighting</h3>
          <p>Oro Valley's outdoor lighting code is strict, and for good reason. Exterior lighting designed around it from the start looks considered. Lighting retrofitted to pass inspection rarely does.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= FACTS ================= -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split split--top">
        <div class="rv">
          <p class="eyebrow">The practical details</p>
          <h2 class="display h-md" style="margin-bottom:28px">Working in Oro Valley.</h2>
          <p class="lede">We are a licensed Arizona general contractor working throughout Pima County. Oro Valley is a short run north from our Moore Road office, which means site visits happen when they need to happen.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rv rv-d1">
          <dl class="deflist">
            <div><dt>Jurisdiction</dt><dd>Town of Oro Valley. Its own permitting and design review</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Areas</dt><dd>Rancho Vistoso, Stone Canyon, Vistoso Highlands, Catalina Shadows, Sun City</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Terrain</dt><dd>Upper bajada and granite outcrop below Pusch Ridge</dd></div>
            <div><dt>We build</dt><dd>Custom homes, whole-home remodels, additions, guest houses, pools and outdoor living</dd></div>
            <div><dt>License</dt><dd>Arizona ROC #324057. General Dual, active</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Telephone</dt><dd><a href="tel:+15209750456">(520) 975-0456</a></dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= TESTIMONIAL ================= -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="quote rv">
        <hr class="rule rule--center">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;This was the 4th home we've had built, all by very good builders, but none reached the level of expertise and attention to detail that Charles provided.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <cite>Homeowner &middot; Custom home client</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= CTA ================= -->
  <section class="cta">
    <div class="cta__media"><Photo src="dc-patio-dusk.jpg" alt="" /></div>
    <div class="cta__inner rv">
      <h2 class="display h-lg">Building in Oro Valley?</h2>
      <p>Tell us about the lot and the scope. If you have not bought yet, that is the best time to talk.</p>
      <div class="cta__btns">
        <a class="btn btn--onDark" href="/contact.html">Start a conversation</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="tel:+15209750456">(520) 975-0456</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
